          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.1.9+JOB.1.10+JOB.1.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yob 1:9-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.3.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 3:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo awinjo dwondi nyatoro m'okoko malo i polo ka waco ni, “Pama both gi meni ma dhum kodi Ker pa Were mawan kodi adhum pa Kristo je otieko tundo! Kole jamisegey ma osa wutmin wan bongi Were, wor g'odieceŋ, otiek wito piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To, jokengila go kodi remo pa Nyathi rombo, kodi wac ma joridho gine adieri; aka oyido joyikere kijala kwo pajo tundo tho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo, polo sangala win, kodi wijoje ma win'iye! To candirok kidho bedo ri piny kodi nam! Kole Jwogi oloro riwin, aka opoŋ gi keme, rupiri go oŋeyo nike odoŋ gi nyaka hongo macek.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo bulir oŋeyo nike otiek wito go piny wi lowo, ocako riemo dhako m'onywolo nyathi ma nyicwo ca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.7.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 7:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.12.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "12:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhako no omiy bwombe ario mapa ango madongo ŋey woay wokidhi i kabedo m'oyik rigo i thim kam'ibino kur'iye go cowo oro adek g'adec, ma thwol no kinyal monj'iye go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo thwol no oŋulo pi gi dhoke pa jwom yuŋey dhako no, nike wonyali mol gi dhako no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To, lowo okonyo dheno; oŋamo dhoke to mwonyo woko mikula ma jwom m'owok i dhok bulir no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo bulir nge omako gi dheno, to kidho cako lweny gi nyikwaye m'odoŋ, ji je ma jowinjo or pa Were aka jonigi genirok iy'adieri pa Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka bulir ocungo dho thengi nam.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
